  "body": "AX Code 7.27.5 ships the analysis-output skill, optional AX BI MCP guidance, and the merge-and-sync-github command. Branch completion preserves canonical case and handles branches sharing a name with a tag. This release integrates reliability fixes across sessions, MCP, worktrees, terminal input, file editing, memory, and promotion/rollback validation. SDK 2.6.36 adds local Git branch enumeration.\n"
